{"articleNo":"93126","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=93126&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 찾아가는 연극공연 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.10.10","hit":"12633","attachments":[{"name":"얼간이들 관람평.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=93126&attachNo=22821"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">깊어가는 가을... </span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">한편의 연극으로 자신의 소리에 귀기울이고 힐링할 수 있는 시간을 가져보는</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;것은 어떨까요?? </span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong>공 연 명 </strong>: 넌버벌퍼포먼스 <strong><font color=\"#0055ff\">&lt;얼간이들&gt;</font></strong> \"말없이 이야기하는 자살 코미디\"</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#d9418d\"><strong>주&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 제 : </strong><u>힘든 삶이라 하더라도 그 삶은 무척이나 고귀하다~ </u></font></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#d9418d\">일&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 시 : 2013. 10. 16(수) 19:30~ 20:30[60분] </font></strong></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#d9418d\">장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소 : 금오공대 학생회관 소공연장 </font></strong></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">기대효과 : 우리대학교 학생들에게 자아성찰 및 힐링의 기회제공</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">제&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 작 : (사) 문화창작집단(공터-다) </span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">관람등급 : 8세이상</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">티켓가격 : 무료</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2013. 10. 10 </span></strong></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong>학 생 처 장</strong> </span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
